<title>UK: Deutsche Ausgleichsbank to set 1.5 bln mark bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Ausgleichsbank to set 1.5 bln mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Ausgleichsbank will launch a 1.5 billion mark July 2007 Euro-Asian bond late on Wednesday, joint lead managers HSBC Trinkaus and Commerzbank said.  </p>
<p>The deal will be priced on Thursday to yield between 14 and 16 basis points over the new 6.0 percent Bund due July 4, 2007.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7718</p>
